{{disambig msg|the composer}}

'''Danny Baranowsky''' is an American music composer, famous for creating the soundtrack for the original ''The Binding of Isaac''. He is also famous for creating the soundtrack to Edmund's other successful game, ''Super Meat Boy,'' along with the OST to 2015's rhythm roguelike game, ''Crypt Of The Necrodancer.''

